            "text-indent",
            "22.5pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "As of October 2, 2015, Alphabet Inc. became the successor issuer of Google Inc. pursuant to Rule 12g-3(a) under the Exchange Act. Our Class A stock has been listed on the Nasdaq Global Select Market under the symbol “GOOG” since August 19, 2004, and under the symbol \"GOOGL\" since April 3, 2014. Prior to August 19, 2004, there was no public market for our stock. Our Class B stock is neither listed nor traded. Our Class C stock has been listed on the Nasdaq Global Select Market under the symbol “GOOG” since April 3, 2014.",
        "text_hash": "c26245196bf3aac138db64bbbc09e643f9375316302db660f7645558b8ab3437",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
